---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — Roofero"
  description="Read Roofero's Terms of Service governing the use of our website and services."
>
  <main class="page-wrapper">
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-24 text-left">
      <span
        class="text-foreground font-heading text-base font-semibold border-b border-foreground pb-1 inline-block mb-8"
      >
        Legal
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-foreground font-heading font-medium tracking-tight mb-8">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground body-text mb-8">
        Last updated: May 24, 2026
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-8 font-sans text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-foreground font-heading text-2xl font-semibold">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing or using our website and services, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you are prohibited from using or accessing our site.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-foreground font-heading text-2xl font-semibold">2. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
          <p>
            Unless otherwise indicated, all content on this site (including text, graphics, logos, images, and designs) is the property of Roofero and is protected by copyright and other intellectual property laws.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-foreground font-heading text-2xl font-semibold">3. Estimate & Booking Accuracy</h2>
          <p>
            All estimates generated through our online forms are non-binding placeholders. Actual pricing and contract details will be determined only after a professional on-site physical roof inspection by our certified roofing technicians.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-foreground font-heading text-2xl font-semibold">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            In no event shall Roofero or its suppliers be liable for any damages arising out of the use or inability to use the materials on our website, even if notified orally or in writing of the possibility of such damage.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
